Source: wasm
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Yago López Prado <yago.lopez.adeje@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/Perkybeet/noust
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wasm
Architecture: all
Depends: noust (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: transitional package for noust
 WASM was renamed to Noust in 3.0.0. This empty package only depends on
 noust, so that upgrading a server that has wasm installed brings noust in.
 .
 The command is noust; wasm remains an alias for the whole 3.x series. This
 package can be removed once noust is installed.
